WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.680
- This next story just made headlines.

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.300
And when I thought I wanted to talk

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.240
to her so bad,

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.210
local news anchor Lena Pringle

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.590
from Florida became the story herself.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:12.210
She posted a photo of
her new short haircut

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.100
and it went viral

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:16.860
and here to tell us why
that is so important

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.816
is Lena Pringle herself.

00:00:18.816 --> 00:00:20.067
(crowd applauding)

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:20.900
- Hi.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.650
- Hi Lena.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:25.483
Thank you so much--

00:00:25.483 --> 00:00:26.580
- Hi, good morning.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:27.413
- Good morning.

00:00:27.413 --> 00:00:28.580
Thank you so much for coming on this show.

00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.650
This story is really important

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.400
and you were experiencing
pressure in the workplace

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.180
and you posted this photo

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:37.610
and it went bananas

00:00:37.610 --> 00:00:40.293
and will you please just
tell me everything about it?

00:00:41.710 --> 00:00:44.450
- [Lena Pringle] Yes so the caption is,

00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:46.620
a shout out to the people who told me

00:00:46.620 --> 00:00:50.040
I wouldn't be able to get
or keep a broadcast news job

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:52.140
with a short natural haircut.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:53.900
Jokes on you, huh?

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.823
With a few cute emojis.

00:00:56.843 --> 00:00:58.353
A few weeks ago,

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.160
I just haven't been in
the best mental state.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.400
I have been depressed.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.233
I've been in a rut.

00:01:04.233 --> 00:01:06.823
I've just not been completely there.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.740
My friend actually sent me
a picture of this haircut

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:13.340
and my hair has already been short,

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.310
so, you know, I was like,

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:16.330
why not try something different?

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:18.390
Cause when you look good, you feel good.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:19.720
I was really just looking for

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:23.560
a morale booster to get
out of such a low time.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:25.910
And so, I went to my hairdresser,

00:01:25.910 --> 00:01:26.950
she hooked me up,

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:28.320
shout out to Keisha,

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.493
she did great here in Jacksonville.

00:01:31.796 --> 00:01:34.410
I took these pictures because I felt good,

00:01:34.410 --> 00:01:35.340
I looked good

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:36.800
and I said, you know what,

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:37.810
let me just post this.

00:01:37.810 --> 00:01:40.910
I post pictures all the time,
so this isn't anything new.

00:01:40.910 --> 00:01:43.260
Now the attention definitely is.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:46.120
- And it's been retweeted
over 10,000 times

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:48.483
with a ton of positive responses.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:50.233
- Yeah.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:52.710
I just can't believe it.

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:56.360
Something that was
literally done as a way to

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:57.580
boost my morale.

00:01:57.580 --> 00:01:59.130
I'm a huge mental health advocate.

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:00.980
So something that was so simple

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:03.110
in nature to me that has

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:04.660
gained so much attention

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:05.870
and encouragement

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:06.920
and support.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.880
I am just, honestly, it's still...

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:09.713
I'm in awe.

00:02:09.713 --> 00:02:11.160
I just can't believe

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:13.000
the outreach from people.

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:15.010
I'm hearing from girls in high school,

00:02:15.010 --> 00:02:17.439
to a women with PhDs,

00:02:17.439 --> 00:02:18.272
to men

00:02:18.272 --> 00:02:19.105
and barbers

00:02:19.105 --> 00:02:21.300
and all types of people who are just

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:24.880
showing their genuine love
and support for authenticity

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.870
and I just can't--

00:02:26.870 --> 00:02:27.880
- Oh, I'm so sorry.

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:28.950
No, I'm so sorry.

00:02:28.950 --> 00:02:32.170
- Oh no, you go ahead.

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:33.920
- One of the things that
I really love about this,

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.270
is the risk that you took.

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:36.550
This wasn't just,

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.350
empowerment and bravery.

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:40.550
You have high stakes at work

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.750
and a Dove study found
that black women are like

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.170
80% more likely to
change their natural hair

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:47.220
to meet expectations in the workplace

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:49.770
and Deb has been leading
this chart with the crown act

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.020
and in fact,

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.447
yesterday ,

00:02:55.320 --> 00:02:58.330
it's announced that they
passed at least in the house

00:02:58.330 --> 00:02:59.163
a bill

00:02:59.163 --> 00:03:01.500
which is one step forward

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.150
to not having hair race-based

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.470
work discrimination.

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:07.910
So I think what you did

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:09.950
is really important for this movement

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:12.515
and Dove even retweeted your photo.

00:03:12.515 --> 00:03:13.348
(crowd applauding)

00:03:13.348 --> 00:03:15.477
- Yeah Dove and the Crown Act.

00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:19.400
I think it's so amazing because in 2020,

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.790
there literally has to be a law passed

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.110
nationwide

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:26.830
to prohibit discrimination
against natural hair.

00:03:26.830 --> 00:03:28.590
Simply the way our hair grows

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:29.760
out of our head,

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:31.980
there has to be a law that's passed

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:34.170
just so we're able to

00:03:34.170 --> 00:03:35.750
not be discriminated against.

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.050
And you know it's crazy because last year

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:40.100
when the Crown Act passed in California,

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:41.630
it was a huge landmark decision

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:44.050
but at that point there
was only a few States

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:45.380
that were behind it.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:48.270
So now to see this pass in
the house and move forward,

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.350
I know for me

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:54.160
and several other black women
in this industry particularly,

00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:56.480
I'm in an industry that's built upon looks

00:03:56.480 --> 00:03:57.423
and aesthetics,

00:03:59.399 --> 00:04:00.650
we stand...

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.230
This charge has been happening
for the past 15 to 20 years.

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:04.660
There have been women that have been

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.060
knocking down the barriers

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.310
that have been saying, you know what?

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:08.580
You will accept me.

00:04:08.580 --> 00:04:10.530
I am going to take up this space.

00:04:10.530 --> 00:04:12.610
So I think it's a
beautiful moment right now

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:14.090
because you're seeing more

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:16.590
black women on air with natural hair,

00:04:16.590 --> 00:04:17.423
locks,

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:18.256
braids,

00:04:18.256 --> 00:04:20.270
literally taking up all the space

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:22.270
and just being who they are.
- Wow.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:23.610
- And it's a beautiful thing

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.850
because we stand on the
shoulders of the women

00:04:25.850 --> 00:04:27.210
that have been knocking down the door

00:04:27.210 --> 00:04:28.780
so that we're able to do this.

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.010
- And I thank you

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.790
for everything that you are doing

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.930
and that's why we wanted to
celebrate you here today.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.210
And thank you for being here

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:37.920
and sharing this story and
breaking this news with us.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.337
And thank you, Lena.

00:04:39.337 --> 00:04:41.920
(upbeat music)

